OL,3,GNEWSAFormer journalist and Lost Lives  
OL,4,Aauthor David McKittrick dies           
OL,6,FThe renowned journalist and author     
OL,7,FDavid McKittrick has died at the age of
OL,8,F77.                                    
OL,10,FMcKittrick was best known for his work 
OL,11,Fduring the Troubles, and the book Lost 
OL,12,FLives.                                 
OL,14,FThe book detailed the people who died  
OL,15,Fas a result of the Troubles.           
OL,17,FIt was first published in 1999 after   
OL,18,Fseveral years of research by McKittrick
OL,19,Fand co-authors Seamus Kelters, Brian   
OL,20,FFeeney and Chris Thornton.             
